{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Kinetune API","version":"1","description":"Lyric videos and Spotify Canvas loops from your songs. The same operations power the app, the MCP server, the CLI and the n8n node."},"servers":[{"url":"https://kinetune.com"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearer":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","description":"An organization API key (kt_live_…) or an OAuth access token"},"oauth2":{"type":"oauth2","flows":{"authorizationCode":{"authorizationUrl":"https://kinetune.com/api/auth/oauth2/authorize","tokenUrl":"https://kinetune.com/api/auth/oauth2/token","scopes":{"videos:read":"See videos, quotes and your credit balance","videos:write":"Quote, create, cancel, retry and delete videos (spends credits)","music:read":"See artists, their photos and songs","music:write":"Add, rename and archive artists and songs, upload songs and artist photos","library:read":"Browse Looks","library:write":"Rename, delete and publish your Looks","organizations:read":"See the organizations you belong to","organizations:write":"Create organizations you own"}}}}}},"paths":{"/api/v1/account":{"get":{"operationId":"account.get","summary":"Get the account","description":"Who you are signed in as, the organization and its credit balance\n\nReturns the organization the credentials act for, how they authenticate and their scopes, the credit balance (available, monthly, top-ups) and its plan, if any (where it is billed and when the period ends). Check it before creating videos.","tags":["account"],"parameters":[],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["videos:read","music:read","library:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"account.get","mcpTool":"get_account","cli":"kinetune account"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/options":{"get":{"operationId":"options.get","summary":"List the options","description":"Video types, Look categories, background sources, formats and the current credit prices\n\nEverything a request can choose from, with the credit table. Use it to pick a category or source and to explain prices.","tags":["account"],"parameters":[],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["videos:read","music:read","library:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"options.get","mcpTool":"get_options","cli":"kinetune options"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/organizations":{"get":{"operationId":"organizations.list","summary":"List your organizations","description":"The organizations you belong to, your role in each and the one these credentials act for\n\nEvery organization the signed-in person is a member of; with an API key, the member who created it (the key needs organizations:read). current marks the organization these credentials act for. Each organization has its own music, videos, Looks and credits: to work in another one, sign in again and pick it on the consent screen, or use an API key created in it.","tags":["account"],"parameters":[],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["organizations:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"organizations.list","mcpTool":"list_organizations","cli":"kinetune organizations list"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"post":{"operationId":"organizations.create","summary":"Create an organization","description":"A new organization owned by you, with its own music, videos, Looks and credits\n\nCreates an empty organization with the signed-in person as its owner; with an API key, the member who created the key (the key needs organizations:write). It starts with no credits. These credentials keep acting for their current organization: to work in the new one, sign in again and pick it, or create an API key in it.","tags":["account"],"parameters":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Create an organization","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":2,"maxLength":80,"description":"The organization name, as people see it in the app"}},"required":["name"]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["organizations:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"organizations.create","mcpTool":"create_organization","cli":"kinetune organizations create"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/artists":{"get":{"operationId":"artists.list","summary":"List artists","description":"Artists by name, with their song and photo counts and a picture\n\nSongs belong to an artist; create the artist first. Sorted by name, 50 per page by default: pass q to search by name, and limit/offset to page.","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Part of the artist name","type":"string","maxLength":100},"description":"Part of the artist name"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Results per page, 1-100 (default 50)","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100},"description":"Results per page, 1-100 (default 50)"},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"How many results to skip","type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"description":"How many results to skip"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:read","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artists.list","mcpTool":"list_artists","cli":"kinetune artists list"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"post":{"operationId":"artists.create","summary":"Create an artist","description":"Add an artist by name\n\nNames are unique per organization (409 when taken).","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Create an artist","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"The artist name"}},"required":["name"]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artists.create","mcpTool":"create_artist","cli":"kinetune artists create"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/artists/{artist_id}":{"get":{"operationId":"artists.get","summary":"Get an artist","description":"One artist","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[{"name":"artist_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The artist id"},"description":"The artist id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:read","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artists.get","mcpTool":"get_artist","cli":"kinetune artists get"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"artists.update","summary":"Rename an artist","description":"Change an artist’s name","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[{"name":"artist_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The artist id"},"description":"The artist id"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Rename an artist","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"The new name"}},"required":["name"]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artists.update","mcpTool":"rename_artist","cli":"kinetune artists rename"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"delete":{"operationId":"artists.archive","summary":"Archive an artist","description":"Remove an artist that has no songs\n\nRefused (409) while the artist still has songs.","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[{"name":"artist_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The artist id"},"description":"The artist id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artists.archive","mcpTool":"archive_artist","cli":"kinetune artists archive"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/artists/{artist_id}/picture":{"post":{"operationId":"artists.set_picture","summary":"Set the artist picture","description":"Choose which photo is the artist’s picture, and how it is cropped to a square\n\nThe picture (image_url on the artist, a 512 px square) is cut from one of the artist’s photos; the photo itself is unchanged. The first photo becomes the picture automatically, centered. crop is in fractions of the photo (its url): x/y the top-left corner, size the side relative to the photo’s short side; leave it out to center.","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[{"name":"artist_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The artist id"},"description":"The artist id"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Set the artist picture","properties":{"photo_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"One of the artist’s photos (list_artist_photos)"},"crop":{"description":"The square to keep, in fractions of the photo; centered when omitted","type":"object","properties":{"x":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"y":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"size":{"type":"number","minimum":0.1,"maximum":1}},"required":["x","y","size"]}},"required":["photo_id"]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artists.set_picture","mcpTool":"set_artist_picture","cli":"kinetune artists picture"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/artists/{artist_id}/photos":{"get":{"operationId":"artist_photos.list","summary":"List artist photos","description":"The artist’s photos (identity references, up to 6)\n\nPhotos keep the artist recognizable when a Look or Canvas shows them; the cover art stays the creative source. url is the photo upright at up to 1536 px (what the AI receives; width and height describe it), thumbnail_url a copy 320 px on its short side for grids.","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[{"name":"artist_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The artist id"},"description":"The artist id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:read","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artist_photos.list","mcpTool":"list_artist_photos","cli":"kinetune artists photos list"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"post":{"operationId":"artist_photos.add","summary":"Add artist photos","description":"Upload one or more photos of the artist (JPEG, PNG or WebP)\n\nUp to 6 per artist, at least 512 px on the short side, up to 15 MB each. Only with the rights to use them (rights_confirmed). They are identity references only: never shown publicly or used as they are. Each is kept upright at up to 1536 px, with a small thumbnail; the uploaded file itself is not kept.","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[{"name":"artist_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The artist id"},"description":"The artist id"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Add artist photos","properties":{"photo_urls":{"description":"Public https URLs of the photos (or upload files with the CLI)","minItems":1,"maxItems":6,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"format":"uri","description":"A public https URL of a photo"}},"rights_confirmed":{"type":"boolean","const":true,"description":"You have the rights to use these photos of the artist"}},"required":["rights_confirmed"]}},"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"photos":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"binary"}}}}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artist_photos.add","mcpTool":"add_artist_photos","cli":"kinetune artists photos add"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/artists/{artist_id}/photos/{photo_id}":{"delete":{"operationId":"artist_photos.delete","summary":"Delete an artist photo","description":"Remove one photo","tags":["artists"],"parameters":[{"name":"artist_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The artist id"},"description":"The artist id"},{"name":"photo_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The photo id"},"description":"The photo id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"artist_photos.delete","mcpTool":"delete_artist_photo","cli":"kinetune artists photos delete"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/songs":{"get":{"operationId":"songs.list","summary":"List songs","description":"Songs with their cover, duration and analysis status\n\nA song must be analyzed (analysis.status \"ready\") before videos can be made. 50 per page by default: pass q to search, and limit/offset to page. cover_art.url is the cover at up to 1536 px (JPEG; width and height describe it), preview_url a 640 px and thumbnail_url a 160 px WebP. Image links are signed for 7 days and stay the same all day, so they can be cached.","tags":["songs"],"parameters":[{"name":"artist_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Only this artist’s songs","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120},"description":"Only this artist’s songs"},{"name":"q","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Part of the song title or artist name","type":"string","maxLength":100},"description":"Part of the song title or artist name"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Results per page, 1-100 (default 50)","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100},"description":"Results per page, 1-100 (default 50)"},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"How many results to skip","type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"description":"How many results to skip"},{"name":"status","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Only songs whose analysis has this status (ready = usable for videos)","type":"string","enum":["pending","processing","ready","failed"]},"description":"Only songs whose analysis has this status (ready = usable for videos)"},{"name":"sort","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"title (default): by artist then title; newest: latest uploads first","type":"string","enum":["title","newest"]},"description":"title (default): by artist then title; newest: latest uploads first"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:read","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"songs.list","mcpTool":"list_songs","cli":"kinetune songs list"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"post":{"operationId":"songs.create","summary":"Upload a song","description":"Add a song: master audio and square cover art\n\nAudio: MP3, WAV or M4A up to 250 MB. Cover: a square JPEG or PNG, 1000–6000 px (3000×3000 recommended), up to 20 MB; it is kept at 1536, 640 and 160 px, not as uploaded. The song is analyzed next (lyrics, beats, sections): poll get_song until analysis.status is \"ready\", usually about a minute.","tags":["songs"],"parameters":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Upload a song","properties":{"artist_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The artist id"},"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":300,"description":"The song title"},"language":{"description":"Lyrics language (ISO 639-1, e.g. \"en\"); detected when omitted","type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z]{2,3}$"},"audio_url":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"format":"uri","description":"A public https URL of the master audio"},"cover_art_url":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"format":"uri","description":"A public https URL of the square cover art"}},"required":["artist_id","title"]}},"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"audio":{"type":"string","format":"binary"},"cover_art":{"type":"string","format":"binary"}}}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"songs.create","mcpTool":"create_song","cli":"kinetune songs create"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/songs/{song_id}":{"get":{"operationId":"songs.get","summary":"Get a song","description":"One song and its analysis status\n\ncover_art.url is the cover at up to 1536 px (JPEG; width and height describe it), preview_url a 640 px and thumbnail_url a 160 px WebP. Image links are signed for 7 days and stay the same all day, so they can be cached.","tags":["songs"],"parameters":[{"name":"song_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The song id"},"description":"The song id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:read","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"songs.get","mcpTool":"get_song","cli":"kinetune songs get"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"songs.update","summary":"Rename a song","description":"Change a song’s title","tags":["songs"],"parameters":[{"name":"song_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The song id"},"description":"The song id"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Rename a song","properties":{"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":300,"description":"The new title"}},"required":["title"]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"songs.update","mcpTool":"rename_song","cli":"kinetune songs rename"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"delete":{"operationId":"songs.archive","summary":"Archive a song","description":"Remove a song (its videos stay)","tags":["songs"],"parameters":[{"name":"song_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The song id"},"description":"The song id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"songs.archive","mcpTool":"archive_song","cli":"kinetune songs archive"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/songs/{song_id}/analysis":{"get":{"operationId":"songs.analysis","summary":"Get a song’s analysis","description":"Word-timed lyrics, tempo, beats, sections and hook\n\nUse the section times to choose a trim for a lyric video.","tags":["songs"],"parameters":[{"name":"song_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The song id"},"description":"The song id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:read","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"songs.analysis","mcpTool":"get_song_analysis","cli":"kinetune songs analysis"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"post":{"operationId":"songs.reanalyze","summary":"Analyze a song again","description":"Retry a failed analysis","tags":["songs"],"parameters":[{"name":"song_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The song id"},"description":"The song id"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Analyze a song again","properties":{},"required":[]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["music:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"songs.reanalyze","mcpTool":"reanalyze_song","cli":"kinetune songs reanalyze"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/looks":{"get":{"operationId":"looks.list","summary":"List Looks","description":"Browse Official, Community and your own Looks\n\nA Look is a complete, reusable lyric-video design. Pass its id as {\"mode\":\"existing\",\"id\":…} to reuse it exactly. A Look that shows an artist (featured_artist) is private and only serves that artist's songs: choosing for a song, pass its artist_id to leave out Looks that show another artist.","tags":["looks"],"parameters":[{"name":"scope","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Which library; default all","type":"string","enum":["all","official","community","mine"]},"description":"Which library; default all"},{"name":"category","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"A category id from get_options","type":"string","maxLength":40},"description":"A category id from get_options"},{"name":"lyric_style","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"A lyric style id from get_options (how the lyrics move)","type":"string","maxLength":40},"description":"A lyric style id from get_options (how the lyrics move)"},{"name":"artist_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"The artist of the song you are choosing for: Looks that show another artist are left out","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120},"description":"The artist of the song you are choosing for: Looks that show another artist are left out"},{"name":"q","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Search words","type":"string","maxLength":100},"description":"Search words"},{"name":"sort","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["newest","popular"]}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991}}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["library:read","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"looks.list","mcpTool":"list_looks","cli":"kinetune looks list"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/looks/{look_id}":{"get":{"operationId":"looks.get","summary":"Get a Look","description":"One Look with its design and preview images\n\nbackgrounds.portrait and backgrounds.landscape are the background plates the video uses; backgrounds.previews has 480 px wide copies of them for thumbnails (null for a Look without a photo or video background).","tags":["looks"],"parameters":[{"name":"look_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The Look id"},"description":"The Look id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["library:read","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"looks.get","mcpTool":"get_look","cli":"kinetune looks get"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"looks.rename","summary":"Rename a Look","description":"Rename one of your Looks","tags":["looks"],"parameters":[{"name":"look_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The Look id"},"description":"The Look id"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Rename a Look","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":2,"maxLength":60,"description":"The new name"}},"required":["name"]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["library:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"looks.rename","mcpTool":"rename_look","cli":"kinetune looks rename"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}},"delete":{"operationId":"looks.delete","summary":"Delete a Look","description":"Remove one of your Looks (videos made with it stay)","tags":["looks"],"parameters":[{"name":"look_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The Look id"},"description":"The Look id"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["library:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"looks.delete","mcpTool":"delete_look","cli":"kinetune looks delete"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/looks/{look_id}/visibility":{"post":{"operationId":"looks.visibility","summary":"Publish or unpublish a Look","description":"Make one of your Looks public (earns 10 credits) or private\n\nPublic Looks join the Community library under your @username. A Look that shows your artist stays private (409).","tags":["looks"],"parameters":[{"name":"look_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The Look id"},"description":"The Look id"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Publish or unpublish a Look","properties":{"visibility":{"type":"string","enum":["public","private"]}},"required":["visibility"]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["library:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"looks.visibility","mcpTool":"set_look_visibility","cli":"kinetune looks visibility"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/backgrounds":{"post":{"operationId":"backgrounds.upload","summary":"Upload a background","description":"Upload your own photo or video to design a New Look around\n\nPhoto: JPEG, PNG or WebP, at least 720 px on the short side, up to 25 MB. Video: MP4, MOV or WebM, 4–180 seconds, at least 720 px on the short side, up to 300 MB; it becomes a seamless loop of up to 20 s. Only with the rights to use it. Then quote a lyric video with look {\"mode\":\"new\",\"category\":\"…\",\"background\":{\"source\":\"upload-photo\" or \"upload-video\",\"upload_id\":\"…\"},\"visibility\":\"private\"}.","tags":["looks"],"parameters":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Upload a background","properties":{"file_url":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"format":"uri","description":"A public https URL of the photo or video"},"rights_confirmed":{"type":"boolean","const":true,"description":"You have the rights to use this photo or video"}},"required":["rights_confirmed"]}},"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"file":{"type":"string","format":"binary"}}}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["library:write","videos:write"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"backgrounds.upload","mcpTool":"upload_background","cli":"kinetune backgrounds upload"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/stock":{"get":{"operationId":"stock.search","summary":"Search stock media","description":"Find Pexels photos or clips to use as a stock background\n\n24 results a page. Pass an item's id as look.background.stock_id (source \"stock-photo\" or \"stock-video\") or as a Canvas's stock_id to use it instead of the director's pick, and credit the photographer (credit) wherever you show it. orientation: portrait for 9:16 and 1:1, landscape when 16:9 is among the formats (a Canvas is portrait). Clips too short for the loop are left out: pass seconds for a Canvas. thumbnail_url is a 480 px still, preview_url a 1280 px one (the photo, or the clip's poster), preview_video_url a small MP4 of a clip.","tags":["looks"],"parameters":[{"name":"kind","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["photo","video"],"description":"photo for stock-photo, video for stock-video"},"description":"photo for stock-photo, video for stock-video"},{"name":"q","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100,"description":"Search words, e.g. \"foggy pine forest\""},"description":"Search words, e.g. \"foggy pine forest\""},{"name":"orientation","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Default portrait","type":"string","enum":["portrait","landscape"]},"description":"Default portrait"},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Default 1; next_page says whether there are more","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":50},"description":"Default 1; next_page says whether there are more"},{"name":"seconds","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"description":"Clips for a Canvas of this length (5–8); omit for a Look's loop","type":"integer","minimum":5,"maximum":8},"description":"Clips for a Canvas of this length (5–8); omit for a Look's loop"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["videos:read","videos:write","library:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"stock.search","mcpTool":"search_stock","cli":"kinetune stock search"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid request"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid credentials"},"402":{"description":"Not enough credits"},"403":{"description":"Missing scope"},"404":{"description":"Not found"},"409":{"description":"Conflict"},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable"},"503":{"description":"Temporarily unavailable (AI video): nothing was held; try again after Retry-After seconds"}}}},"/api/v1/quotes":{"post":{"operationId":"quotes.create","summary":"Quote a lyric video or Quote a Canvas","description":"The exact credits for a lyric video, before anything is charged\n\nReturns quote_id, credits (total), credits_per_video and a breakdown. Always quote first and tell the user the credits before creating; credits are reserved at creation and charged only when the video is delivered. A quote is valid for 30 minutes.\n\nThe exact credits for a Spotify Canvas, before anything is charged\n\nReturns quote_id, credits and a breakdown. Always quote first and tell the user the credits before creating; credits are reserved at creation and charged only when the video is delivered.","tags":["videos"],"parameters":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","title":"Quote a lyric video","properties":{"type":{"const":"lyric-video"},"song_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The song id"},"variations":{"default":1,"description":"1–4 different New Looks, one video each (an Existing Look renders one)","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":4},"callback_url":{"description":"An https URL to POST the finished video to (signed; see Callbacks). Quote and create with the same value","type":"string","maxLength":2000},"metadata":{"description":"Your own JSON (an order id, for example): kept with the video and returned in its request. Quote and create with the same value","type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"look":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"mode":{"type":"string","const":"new"},"category":{"type":"string","enum":["release","fall","halloween","christmas","summer","valentines","mood","retro","synthwave","street","nature","luxury","abstract","minimal","neon","pop-art","lo-fi","grunge","cosmic","cyber","dreamy"]},"background":{"default":{"quality":"high"},"type":"object","properties":{"source":{"type":"string","enum":["ai-image","ai-video","stock-photo","stock-video","upload-photo","upload-video","designed"]},"quality":{"default":"high","type":"string","enum":["standard","high","ultra"]},"upload_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120},"scenes":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":4},"stock_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^\\d{1,20}$"}},"additionalProperties":false},"visibility":{"default":"private","type":"string","enum":["private","public"]},"direction":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},"feature_artist":{"default":"never","type":"string","enum":["never","always"]},"lyric_style":{"type":"string","enum":["showcase","block-stack","punch","depth-scatter","neon","terminal","cinematic","player","lo-fi","zine","glitch","pop-art","dreamy","chrome","visualizer","minimal","outline","messages","vinyl","album","tv","cube","cassette","phone","glass","embers","ink","smoke","stardust","drip","rain","screen","behind","big-type"]}},"required":["mode","category"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"mode":{"type":"string","const":"existing"},"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120},"lyric_style":{"type":"string","enum":["showcase","block-stack","punch","depth-scatter","neon","terminal","cinematic","player","lo-fi","zine","glitch","pop-art","dreamy","chrome","visualizer","minimal","outline","messages","vinyl","album","tv","cube","cassette","phone","glass","embers","ink","smoke","stardust","drip","rain","screen","behind","big-type"]}},"required":["mode","id"],"additionalProperties":false}],"description":"{\"mode\":\"existing\",\"id\":\"look_…\"} to reuse a saved Look (add \"lyric_style\" to render it in another lyric style, at no extra cost), or {\"mode\":\"new\",\"category\":\"…\",\"lyric_style\":\"…\",\"background\":{\"source\":\"ai-image\",\"quality\":\"high\"},\"visibility\":\"private\",\"direction\":\"…\"} to have one designed (background.source \"upload-photo\"/\"upload-video\" with background.upload_id from upload_background designs it around your own media; such a Look stays private. \"stock-photo\"/\"stock-video\" with background.stock_id from search_stock uses that Pexels item instead of the director's pick). lyric_style (optional, from get_options) sets how the lyrics are presented and animated: block-stack, punch, player, neon, terminal, cinematic… Omit it and the director picks one. background.scenes (2–4, AI image only) makes that many shots of the same world that cut on the song's sections, each priced like the first. The singer is left out unless asked: feature_artist \"always\" (default \"never\") makes them the subject of the background, recognizable from their artist photos (add_artist_photos); it needs an AI image or AI video background, a private Look and display.cover false (the cover would hide them), and that Look then only serves this artist's songs. A saved Look that shows an artist (featured_artist) only serves that artist's songs, also with display.cover false"},"aspect_ratios":{"default":["9:16"],"description":"Formats to render, each its own file: \"9:16\" (vertical), \"16:9\" (wide), \"1:1\" (square)","minItems":1,"maxItems":3,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["9:16","16:9","1:1"]}},"display":{"default":{"title":true,"artist":true,"cover":true,"lyrics":true,"badges":true},"description":"Which elements show (title, artist, cover, lyrics, badges, headline) and their sizes. cover must be false to show the artist in the background","type":"object","properties":{"title":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"artist":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"cover":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"lyrics":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"badges":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"headline":{"type":"string","enum":["none","new-release","out-now","coming-soon","listen-now"]},"cover_scale":{"type":"number","minimum":0.75,"maximum":1.25},"text_scale":{"type":"number","minimum":0.85,"maximum":1.3},"artist_scale":{"type":"number","minimum":0.85,"maximum":1.5},"spacing_scale":{"type":"number","minimum":0.75,"maximum":1.5}},"additionalProperties":false},"trim":{"description":"Render only this section of the song (at least 8 seconds)","type":"object","properties":{"start_seconds":{"type":"number","minimum":0},"end_seconds":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0}},"required":["start_seconds","end_seconds"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["type","song_id","look"]},{"type":"object","title":"Quote a Canvas","properties":{"type":{"const":"canvas"},"song_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"The song id"},"variations":{"default":1,"description":"1–4 different Canvases","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":4},"callback_url":{"description":"An https URL to POST the finished video to (signed; see Callbacks). Quote and create with the same value","type":"string","maxLength":2000},"metadata":{"description":"Your own JSON (an order id, for example): kept with the video and returned in its request. Quote and create with the same value","type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"source":{"default":"ai-video","description":"ai-video (default), ai-image, stock-photo or stock-video","type":"string","enum":["ai-video","ai-image","stock-photo","stock-video"]},"quality":{"default":"standard","description":"AI video model tier: standard or high","type":"string","enum":["standard","high"]},"resolution":{"default":"1080p","description":"1080p (1080×1920) or 720p","type":"string","enum":["720p","1080p"]},"style":{"description":"Optional visual style","type":"string","enum":["cinematic","dreamy","abstract","surreal","retro","minimal","dark","vibrant","nature","urban"]},"direction":{"description":"Optional mood, motifs or references; the concept still comes from the cover","type":"string","maxLength":2000},"feature_artist":{"default":"auto","description":"Whether the Canvas shows the artist: auto (the director decides), always or never (AI sources; needs artist photos for \"always\")","type":"string","enum":["auto","always","never"]},"seconds":{"default":8,"description":"Canvas length in whole seconds, 5–8 (default 8). Spotify loops it, so no part of the song is chosen","type":"integer","minimum":5,"maximum":8},"stock_id":{"description":"With a stock source: the Pexels photo or video (search_stock with seconds) to use instead of the director's pick","type":"string","pattern":"^\\d{1,20}$"}},"required":["type","song_id"]}]}}}},"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"oauth2":["videos:write","videos:read"]}],"x-operations":[{"id":"quotes.lyric_video","mcpTool":"quote_lyric_vid